home.js       : just imports main.js (also imports some util files)
main.js       : calls new App(), new Game()
app.js        : App class, handles ui state
game.js       : Game class, handles game mechanics, 
              new Updater(), new Renderer(), new Camera(), new Map()
              new Sprite(), new Animation(), new AudioManager()
              new PathFinder(), new GameClient(), new Character()

starts game loop uses requestAnimFrame() for client graphic updates

